      "updated": 1793138447471,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solid arrow: runtime call (gRPC between services; HTTP to Keycloak).  Dashed: search indexing pipeline (CDC).\nKong also routes /reviews → review and /payment → payment. JWTs are minted by the auth service; Kong only\nverifies them.\nStripe sends payment webhooks back to the payment service.",
