      "originalText": "Solid arrow: runtime call (gRPC between services; HTTP to Keycloak).  Dashed: search indexing pipeline (CDC).\nKong also routes /reviews → review and /payment → payment. JWTs are minted by the auth service; Kong only verifies them.\nStripe sends payment webhooks back to the payment service.",
